WEBVTT

00:25.640 --> 00:27.510
Wait, we didn't make a single penny,

00:27.510 --> 00:29.030
and spent 200 yuan on car repairs.

00:29.030 --> 00:29.920
Can you even drive properly?

00:29.920 --> 00:30.480
Huh?

00:32.430 --> 00:33.070
What?

00:37.640 --> 00:39.100
A-Are you listening to me?

00:50.600 --> 00:51.030
No...

00:51.050 --> 00:51.850
Please don't.

00:56.290 --> 00:57.490
What are you doing?

00:58.710 --> 01:00.440
Were it not for these two jerks,

01:00.640 --> 01:01.640
would you pay the 30,000 yuan
for car repairs

01:01.640 --> 01:02.900
out of your own pocket?

01:15.710 --> 01:16.590
-Bro!
-All right, enough.

01:16.590 --> 01:17.450
That's enough.

01:25.840 --> 01:26.700
Do you know why?

01:27.310 --> 01:27.920
I know.

01:28.510 --> 01:30.910
The car repair
costs 50,000 yuan this time.

01:30.950 --> 01:31.840
W-Wasn't it 30,000 yuan?

01:31.840 --> 01:32.570
70,000 yuan.

01:33.680 --> 01:34.310
Then 50,000 yuan is fine...

01:34.310 --> 01:35.509
E-Enough, cut it out.

01:36.000 --> 01:37.259
120,000 yuan in total.

01:37.930 --> 01:39.930
Can you pay it off in a couple of days?

01:40.509 --> 01:41.350
Can you?

01:41.350 --> 01:42.430
-Yes!
-No!

01:42.509 --> 01:44.070
-Yes, yes.
-Yes, yes.

03:07.570 --> 03:11.350
[Born with Luck]

03:11.430 --> 03:14.330
[Episode 18]

03:30.120 --> 03:31.120
That's not right.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.430
43 million.

03:35.910 --> 03:36.470
For 9.

03:37.150 --> 03:39.630
It shouldn't be 47 million.

03:41.079 --> 03:42.240
It should be

03:42.840 --> 03:47.030
4.77 million...

03:49.710 --> 03:51.430
and 777.

03:58.079 --> 03:59.410
I pressed an extra zero.

04:00.430 --> 04:01.430
Thank God I didn't transfer it.

04:01.430 --> 04:02.430
So embarrassing.

04:24.590 --> 04:27.280
[Liu Bei's Location] [Pinghe]

05:23.130 --> 05:23.360
[Liu Bei's Location] [Pinghe]

06:51.920 --> 06:53.720
Can you snatch our things again?

07:13.900 --> 07:17.470
[Rongcheng]

07:15.120 --> 07:15.600
Hello,

07:16.310 --> 07:17.370
this is Rongcheng.

07:19.430 --> 07:19.870
Hello?

07:42.120 --> 07:42.560
Uncle,

07:43.510 --> 07:44.310
it's all done.

07:45.000 --> 07:45.800
Where is the stuff?

07:45.800 --> 07:46.310
I got it.

07:46.950 --> 07:47.610
Where is he?

07:49.000 --> 07:50.240
I'll bring him back in a bit.

07:50.240 --> 07:50.800
Okay.

07:50.950 --> 07:52.150
I'll sharpen the axe.

07:52.270 --> 07:52.950
Uncle,

07:53.950 --> 07:55.680
I just checked Liu Bei's phone.

07:56.510 --> 07:57.710
The last call was made

07:58.480 --> 07:59.830
to Rongcheng Group.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.330
You suspect Liu Bei was

08:03.330 --> 08:04.730
instructed by Zhou Rong?

08:04.750 --> 08:05.500
I don't know.

08:05.680 --> 08:06.560
I can't tell.

08:07.070 --> 08:08.000
Come back first.

08:33.030 --> 08:33.760
Who is there?

08:36.120 --> 08:36.760
Ren,

08:36.789 --> 08:37.549
it's me, me,

08:38.240 --> 08:39.710
Du Cong, Du Cong.

08:40.630 --> 08:41.960
What are you doing here?

08:42.390 --> 08:42.880
Yeah,

08:42.909 --> 08:44.039
w-what am I doing...

08:44.360 --> 08:45.020
Out with it!

08:45.200 --> 08:46.200
Ren is asking you!

08:47.080 --> 08:48.390
Are you tailing us?

08:48.960 --> 08:49.440
No!

08:50.000 --> 08:50.480
I...

08:50.600 --> 08:54.030
I... I-I was being tailed.

08:55.000 --> 08:56.260
You were being tailed?

08:57.000 --> 08:58.130
Who was tailing you?

08:59.150 --> 09:00.350
I don't know, either.

09:00.440 --> 09:02.080
I... I was planning to go back
to the company

09:02.080 --> 09:03.750
to check if I turned off my heater.

09:03.750 --> 09:05.550
But as soon as I got out of the car,

09:05.670 --> 09:06.960
2 people rushed toward me.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.610
I got scared and hid here.

09:08.870 --> 09:09.530
Oh, please.

09:10.150 --> 09:11.270
Who do you think you are?

09:11.270 --> 09:12.600
Why would you be tailed?

09:12.630 --> 09:13.240
What?

09:13.320 --> 09:16.120
You think you're a target
for assassination, huh?

09:16.630 --> 09:18.030
W-What's wrong, Ren?

09:21.960 --> 09:23.820
Where are the people tailing you?

09:29.050 --> 09:30.240
I'm not sure.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.600
I hid in the car

09:31.670 --> 09:32.960
and didn't dare to look outside.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.420
Are you telling the truth?

09:35.270 --> 09:36.800
I'm a bastard if I lie to you.

09:50.030 --> 09:51.000
I remember your girlfriend

09:51.000 --> 09:52.320
has been asking to borrow your car,

09:52.320 --> 09:52.840
right?

09:54.480 --> 09:56.080
But I've never lent it to her.

09:56.390 --> 09:56.960
Ren,

09:57.240 --> 09:58.510
if she asks to borrow it again,

09:58.510 --> 09:59.600
I'll break up with her.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.370
Don't. She's a nice girl.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.490
Give me the key.

10:06.440 --> 10:07.550
Drive my car

10:07.870 --> 10:09.630
and give it to her right now.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.840
You're almost 30.

10:13.270 --> 10:14.840
You finally got a girlfriend.

10:14.840 --> 10:16.360
You definitely can't break up.

10:16.360 --> 10:16.960
Take this.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.270
Ren.

10:22.600 --> 10:22.840
I...

10:22.840 --> 10:23.640
Get in the car!

10:46.050 --> 10:47.650
We're staying here tonight.

10:47.810 --> 10:49.150
Ren, what's wrong?

10:53.080 --> 10:54.540
Hope I'm overthinking it.

11:02.030 --> 11:02.550
Hello.

11:03.200 --> 11:03.790
Li.

11:04.690 --> 11:05.950
Don't hang up, don't.

11:06.670 --> 11:08.670
Who said I wouldn't lend you the car?

11:09.440 --> 11:10.930
You know what? Because of this,

11:10.930 --> 11:12.590
I even had a fight with my boss.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.120
I told him,

11:13.120 --> 11:13.910
"If you don't lend me the car,

11:13.910 --> 11:14.720
I'll quit."

11:15.870 --> 11:16.360
See?

11:16.910 --> 11:18.170
Why would I brag to you?

11:19.270 --> 11:21.000
Ren gave me the car key himself.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.180
I'm on my way to your place.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.320
Don't worry.

11:26.720 --> 11:29.180
I absolutely won't delay
your use of the car.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.900
[Xiangji Temple Intersection]

12:08.560 --> 12:12.830
[Xiangji Temple Intersection]

12:13.860 --> 12:14.670
Found it!

12:19.070 --> 12:20.740
Five o'clock,
at Xiangji Temple Intersection.

12:20.740 --> 12:24.160
[Xiangji Temple Intersection]

12:21.000 --> 12:22.860
Liu Bei went in and never came out.

12:25.320 --> 12:25.840
Let's go.

12:25.840 --> 12:26.370
Let's go!

12:41.600 --> 12:42.240
Alright.

12:46.030 --> 12:47.080
No matter what, we have to get

12:47.080 --> 12:48.410
our first deal tonight.

12:50.960 --> 12:52.560
But no one is taking the bait.

12:54.790 --> 12:55.270
What?

12:55.290 --> 12:56.050
I'm saying,

12:56.390 --> 12:56.990
w-well,

12:57.020 --> 12:58.420
no one is taking the bait.

13:01.750 --> 13:02.930
Could it be that

13:02.960 --> 13:04.440
they see two people in the car

13:04.440 --> 13:06.000
and don't dare to get in?

13:08.440 --> 13:09.500
You've got a point.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.850
What are you doing?

13:13.030 --> 13:13.860
You

13:14.360 --> 13:15.630
go find a target yourself.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.350
When you find one,
bring them to the river.

13:17.350 --> 13:18.440
I'll wait for you there.

13:18.440 --> 13:19.500
Then it's settled.

13:19.550 --> 13:21.170
No, w-why should I go?

13:21.200 --> 13:22.460
Because you can drive.

13:22.910 --> 13:23.660
Go!

13:26.480 --> 13:27.280
Curse my life.

14:39.150 --> 14:40.280
Where are you going?

14:43.320 --> 14:45.360
You can put it in the trunk.

14:57.510 --> 14:58.360
It's fine.

14:59.900 --> 15:01.240
My stuff...

15:01.270 --> 15:02.270
Why is it so heavy?

15:02.360 --> 15:06.330
It can't be out of my sight.

15:10.170 --> 15:11.550
Go around, go around.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.530
You may go around.

15:12.530 --> 15:13.730
Hop in from this side.

15:14.320 --> 15:14.950
Get in from this side.

15:14.950 --> 15:15.810
Just go around.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.770
[Police]

15:43.820 --> 15:45.420
[Police]

15:45.420 --> 15:45.680
[Police]

16:00.000 --> 16:01.730
How are we supposed to find him?

16:03.670 --> 16:04.750
Let's split up to search.

16:04.750 --> 16:05.150
Yes.

16:05.360 --> 16:05.890
Let's go.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.030
Chief!

16:41.510 --> 16:42.110
The blood.

16:44.840 --> 16:46.040
It's in the sand pile.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.540
Walk close along the edge.

17:27.310 --> 17:28.270
Bastard.

17:28.690 --> 17:30.710
[Liu Bei's Location] [Pinghe]

17:29.030 --> 17:30.230
How dare you run away?

17:30.520 --> 17:31.720
I'm going to kill you.

18:01.240 --> 18:03.240
-What are you doing?
-You scared me.

18:08.790 --> 18:10.320
What is this? It's so heavy.

18:12.700 --> 18:14.750
-Didn't you tell me you'd come that way?
-Didn't you tell me you'd come that way?

18:14.750 --> 18:17.590
-And then I came from this side...
-And then I came from this side...

18:17.590 --> 18:18.410
You go first.

18:18.880 --> 18:19.670
You go first.

18:20.270 --> 18:21.640
Tinggang, you know what?

18:21.640 --> 18:22.900
I was so smart just now.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.550
That guy put the suitcase
in the back seat.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.610
-I said...
-Drive.

18:25.960 --> 18:27.110
Right! You understand me!

18:27.110 --> 18:27.750
So I drove...

18:27.750 --> 18:28.960
I'm telling you to drive!

18:28.960 --> 18:30.090
Understand my foot.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.400
Disgusting.

18:33.400 --> 18:34.550
I didn't mean

18:34.590 --> 18:35.650
I understand you.

18:35.680 --> 18:36.640
I meant you didn't understand me.

18:36.640 --> 18:37.350
I know.

18:37.640 --> 18:38.200
Yes,

18:38.480 --> 18:39.480
understand my foot.

18:39.480 --> 18:40.160
Hurry up.

18:41.200 --> 18:42.400
They're catching up.

18:48.660 --> 18:51.710
[Liu Bei's Location] [Pinghe]

19:10.110 --> 19:11.010
Don't. Don't.

19:11.040 --> 19:12.130
Be gentle. Gentle.

19:12.310 --> 19:13.490
Why is it so heavy?

19:13.510 --> 19:14.490
Don't break it.

19:15.460 --> 19:17.030
[Pingjiang Road]
[Binjiang Road] [Zhoujia Town]

19:19.490 --> 19:21.760
[Pingjiang Road]
[Binjiang Road] [Zhoujia Town]

19:20.520 --> 19:21.370
Why is it gone?

19:32.720 --> 19:33.440
[Pingjiang Road]
[Binjiang Road] [Zhoujia Town]

19:33.460 --> 19:34.760
[Setting] [Reboot]

19:34.990 --> 19:36.410
[Your device will reboot.] [Yes.]

19:36.480 --> 19:36.880
[Leading 3G life]

19:39.510 --> 19:40.910
What treasure is inside?

19:41.950 --> 19:42.810
Nice treasure.

19:43.110 --> 19:44.000
What treasure?

19:47.590 --> 19:48.320
Take it slow.

19:48.400 --> 19:49.680
What are you doing? Don't be too excited.

19:49.680 --> 19:50.240
I'm opening it.

19:50.240 --> 19:51.240
Open it.

19:56.110 --> 19:57.020
How is it?

19:57.240 --> 19:57.870
Is it good?

19:58.110 --> 19:59.490
Just tell me if it's good.

19:59.490 --> 20:00.310
Is it gold?

20:01.720 --> 20:02.310
Is it...

20:13.270 --> 20:14.070
Brake! Brake!

20:15.030 --> 20:15.680
Brake!

20:27.960 --> 20:30.390
[Pingjiang Road]
[Binjiang Road] [Zhoujia Town]

21:28.110 --> 21:29.170
It's you two again.

21:32.070 --> 21:32.550
Bro.

21:33.750 --> 21:34.970
C-Cut it out!

21:35.000 --> 21:35.960
R-Run now!

21:38.960 --> 21:39.790
Sorry!

21:54.110 --> 21:56.940
[Honey]

21:54.160 --> 21:55.690
Honey, I'm waiting for you.

21:55.830 --> 21:57.430
Remember to fill up the tank.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.740
Karma is going to come for this woman!

22:11.920 --> 22:12.400
Hello?

22:13.790 --> 22:14.550
Ren.

22:17.400 --> 22:19.070
I got hit.

22:20.030 --> 22:20.890
What happened?

22:21.920 --> 22:22.920
Ren.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.000
It really isn't

22:26.030 --> 22:27.520
my fault this time.

22:28.510 --> 22:30.310
It's definitely not your fault.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.110
Really.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.550
Please believe me.

22:32.920 --> 22:34.250
Of course I believe you.

22:34.590 --> 22:36.790
You don't need to pay for the car repair.

22:36.880 --> 22:37.680
Just rest assured

22:37.680 --> 22:38.740
and go wait at home.

22:39.070 --> 22:39.920
Ren.

23:03.880 --> 23:05.400
Chief Zhang, Captain Wang.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.960
Liu Bei brought the sand inside,

23:06.960 --> 23:08.400
cleaned up the blood on the floor,

23:08.400 --> 23:09.920
and then swept the sand out.

23:09.920 --> 23:10.920
After a couple of days,

23:10.920 --> 23:12.440
the bloodstains could hardly be found.

23:12.440 --> 23:13.700
He is indeed a veteran.

23:14.680 --> 23:15.310
Why would

23:16.110 --> 23:17.440
Liu Bei be the murderer?

23:18.520 --> 23:19.310
Why couldn't it be

23:19.310 --> 23:20.640
that Liu Bei was killed?

23:21.750 --> 23:22.750
Liu Bei can fight,

23:22.750 --> 23:23.830
and he is a desperado.

23:23.830 --> 23:25.430
Would he be killed by others?

23:26.880 --> 23:28.050
A desperado who can fight

23:28.050 --> 23:29.850
is not necessarily invincible.

23:30.310 --> 23:31.830
Why couldn't it be that another desperado

23:31.830 --> 23:33.100
with greater strength

23:33.240 --> 23:34.400
killed Liu Bei?

23:36.790 --> 23:37.790
That makes sense.

23:37.880 --> 23:38.880
That makes sense?

23:39.070 --> 23:40.590
But we haven't seen the body.

23:40.590 --> 23:41.310
How can we confirm

23:41.310 --> 23:42.640
that Liu Bei was killed?

23:42.720 --> 23:43.880
With that amount of blood

23:43.880 --> 23:44.830
in the sand outside,

23:44.830 --> 23:46.110
the person definitely couldn't survive.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.160
You haven't tested the blood yet.

23:47.160 --> 23:49.160
How can you be sure it's human blood?

23:51.880 --> 23:53.350
Chief Zhang, Captain Wang,

23:53.350 --> 23:55.440
Lang Bowen was beaten up at Fenglinwan.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.100
Who did it?

23:56.270 --> 23:57.550
We're still looking into the details.

23:57.550 --> 24:00.350
Lang Bowen has been sent
to the People's Hospital.

24:00.920 --> 24:01.880
Should we go there?

24:01.880 --> 24:02.540
Yes.

24:02.740 --> 24:03.640
I'll go there with Li Qian.

24:03.640 --> 24:04.440
You two keep an eye on things here.

24:04.440 --> 24:04.770
Okay.

24:07.880 --> 24:10.370
Doubt the doubt of the doubt.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.400
Get to work.

24:12.750 --> 24:14.410
What are you wondering about?

24:17.160 --> 24:18.160
What do you think?

24:19.030 --> 24:20.720
Let's assume that Liu Bei is really dead.

24:20.720 --> 24:21.720
It must have something to do

24:21.720 --> 24:22.480
with the transaction

24:22.480 --> 24:24.010
in Zhou Rong's villa today.

24:24.270 --> 24:25.200
What do you mean?

24:26.200 --> 24:27.440
This method is too professional.

24:27.440 --> 24:29.030
It's not like the work of ordinary people.

24:29.030 --> 24:30.070
The only ones I can think of

24:30.070 --> 24:31.270
are Zhou Rong's gang.

24:32.310 --> 24:33.840
It might also be the seller.

24:34.480 --> 24:36.000
After all, anyone who dares
to resell bianzhong

24:36.000 --> 24:37.660
is surely no ordinary person.

24:39.110 --> 24:39.830
Why

24:41.110 --> 24:42.270
couldn't it be that Liu Bei

24:42.270 --> 24:43.470
killed the other one?

24:44.030 --> 24:45.030
That's unlikely.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.950
Liu Bei was being hunted.

24:47.750 --> 24:49.200
Even if he killed someone,

24:49.200 --> 24:50.310
he wouldn't spend so much effort

24:50.310 --> 24:51.570
cleaning up the scene.

24:51.680 --> 24:53.080
Escaping mattered more.

24:53.640 --> 24:54.400
But

24:54.480 --> 24:56.480
Zhou Rong or Zhu Yifei's gang

24:57.310 --> 24:58.480
would do this to cover their tracks

24:58.480 --> 24:59.200
and continue

24:59.200 --> 25:00.200
the transaction.

25:00.400 --> 25:01.070
Therefore,

25:02.590 --> 25:04.000
can this case now be merged

25:04.000 --> 25:05.930
and handled with Zhou Rong's case?

25:07.920 --> 25:09.200
That's for the higher-ups to decide.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.930
I wouldn't dare to say too much.

25:13.550 --> 25:15.280
You're very meticulous, girl.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.760
Why are you sighing?

25:35.880 --> 25:36.720
I just drank too much

25:36.720 --> 25:38.230
and got into a fight.

25:38.510 --> 25:39.550
It's nothing.

25:40.110 --> 25:41.240
Hurry up and go home.

25:42.070 --> 25:43.550
I'll stay here with you tonight.

25:43.550 --> 25:45.010
Why would you stay with me?

25:45.440 --> 25:46.480
Can you give injections

25:46.480 --> 25:47.680
or change dressings?

25:48.830 --> 25:50.270
What if you need
to use the bathroom at night?

25:50.270 --> 25:51.570
There are so many people outside.

25:51.570 --> 25:53.030
I don't need you to help me.

25:53.440 --> 25:54.510
Just leave now.

25:55.880 --> 25:56.380
Bowen,

25:56.640 --> 25:57.840
Zhang Yi'ang is here.

26:01.350 --> 26:02.510
Hurry! Go to the bathroom!

26:02.510 --> 26:04.170
Hide in the bathroom for a bit.

26:11.590 --> 26:13.050
Did we go to the wrong room?

26:16.550 --> 26:17.340
Chief Zhang.

26:17.680 --> 26:18.410
Oh, it's you.

26:19.440 --> 26:20.160
Officer Li.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.650
What happened?

26:21.660 --> 26:23.270
I've been waiting for you.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.440
What's wrong?

26:24.590 --> 26:26.050
I got beaten up by someone.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.200
You got beaten up?

26:28.200 --> 26:28.850
By whom?

26:29.200 --> 26:30.730
How many of them were there?

26:32.590 --> 26:33.610
Two.

26:33.750 --> 26:34.510
Two.

26:34.750 --> 26:37.520
[Patient's bedside card]
[Name: Lang Bowen]

26:38.480 --> 26:39.550
Three.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.460
Four.

26:43.590 --> 26:44.910
Five? Or six?

26:45.200 --> 26:45.880
Lang Bowen,

26:46.590 --> 26:47.590
we don't have time

26:47.590 --> 26:49.190
to joke around with you here.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.070
Look at me.

26:53.440 --> 26:56.220
I'm in no mood to joke around with you.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.000
Chief Zhang.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.830
I don't know
if it's because I drank too much

27:10.830 --> 27:12.110
or if it's from the beating

27:12.110 --> 27:13.840
that I might have a concussion.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.930
When I look at you now,

27:17.110 --> 27:18.480
I see double.

27:20.400 --> 27:21.310
D-Don't move.

27:21.350 --> 27:22.400
If you move, I see four.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.310
Oh, no, I feel nauseous.

27:23.310 --> 27:24.110
Nauseous?

27:24.960 --> 27:25.680
Did you also not see clearly

27:25.680 --> 27:26.940
what they looked like?

27:27.750 --> 27:29.050
Let me think.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.640
Take your time to recall.

27:32.270 --> 27:33.480
I didn't see clearly.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.880
Fenglinwan has surveillance cameras.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.570
You can go ask Lu Yibo
to check the footage.

27:41.830 --> 27:42.960
Since it's about me,

27:43.400 --> 27:45.340
he wouldn't dare take it lightly.

27:47.830 --> 27:48.510
Oh, right.

27:49.550 --> 27:51.350
The surveillance system was upgraded
last night.

27:51.350 --> 27:52.590
All cameras in Fenglinwan

27:52.590 --> 27:53.790
were down for 2 hours.

27:55.240 --> 27:55.830
For real?

27:57.510 --> 27:58.200
For real.

28:01.310 --> 28:02.270
You've checked?

28:04.790 --> 28:05.590
Get well soon.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.320
Rest well.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.040
Chief Zhang,

28:08.270 --> 28:10.480
you can't just leave like this.

28:10.510 --> 28:11.240
Chief Zhang,

28:11.720 --> 28:12.880
I was beaten up like this

28:12.880 --> 28:14.430
for no reason.

28:15.200 --> 28:17.860
You can't just
ask several questions and leave.

28:18.550 --> 28:20.170
You can't do this to me.

28:20.200 --> 28:20.750
Let go.

28:20.880 --> 28:21.960
We can talk properly.

28:21.960 --> 28:22.760
Let go of me.

28:22.880 --> 28:23.820
Chief Zhang,

28:24.160 --> 28:25.480
who beat me up?

28:26.310 --> 28:27.920
Why did they do this to me?

28:28.510 --> 28:29.830
I won't dare to go out

28:30.680 --> 28:32.210
until this is figured out.

28:32.240 --> 28:32.970
Chief Zhang,

28:33.680 --> 28:36.200
is this still a society ruled by law?

28:36.270 --> 28:37.550
Did you notice anything?

28:37.550 --> 28:39.680
He's injured, but still quite strong.

28:45.070 --> 28:48.590
You can't do this to me.

28:50.160 --> 28:51.260
A wasted trip.

28:56.550 --> 28:57.350
What's wrong?

28:58.350 --> 28:58.880
Two.

29:01.480 --> 29:03.680
There should be two people who beat him.

29:04.050 --> 29:04.640
He paused for a second

29:04.640 --> 29:05.510
and then said three or four.

29:05.510 --> 29:06.350
He said three or four

29:06.350 --> 29:07.410
just to confuse us.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.770
The truth is in the details.

29:10.510 --> 29:11.270
And when he talked about

29:11.270 --> 29:12.030
the people who hit him,

29:12.030 --> 29:13.030
he said "they."

29:13.680 --> 29:14.790
"They" means it wasn't just one person.

29:14.790 --> 29:16.350
Most likely, there were two.

29:16.350 --> 29:17.720
Zhou Rong was also robbed by two people.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.270
Could these two

29:18.270 --> 29:19.000
be those two?

29:19.880 --> 29:21.720
"They" could also mean three or four.

29:21.720 --> 29:22.480
Five or six.

29:22.790 --> 29:23.350
See?

29:24.000 --> 29:25.110
Why must it be two?

29:28.310 --> 29:29.370
I told you

29:29.680 --> 29:30.970
he said two at first,

29:31.070 --> 29:31.930
then paused,

29:31.960 --> 29:33.220
and said three or four.

29:34.000 --> 29:35.130
He said three or four

29:35.550 --> 29:37.080
just in order to confuse us.

29:37.920 --> 29:39.180
These are the details.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.830
Eight pieces.

30:13.640 --> 30:14.410
Uncle.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.600
Everything's ready.

30:18.880 --> 30:19.940
Where is the stuff?

30:23.720 --> 30:24.930
I already got it.

30:26.000 --> 30:27.060
I put Liu Bei's body

30:27.070 --> 30:28.310
in the box for the bianzhong

30:28.310 --> 30:29.110
to bring back.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.410
I went outside to take a taxi.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.970
Just as I put the box in the car,

30:35.880 --> 30:37.070
the driver ran away.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.640
Oh, my god.

30:46.160 --> 30:46.880
Zheng,

30:47.480 --> 30:49.370
you got robbed

30:49.400 --> 30:50.330
by a taxi driver?

30:50.830 --> 30:51.920
It definitely wasn't

30:51.920 --> 30:52.990
an ordinary taxi driver!

30:52.990 --> 30:54.850
He must be Zhou Rong's man, Uncle!

31:07.510 --> 31:08.290
Uncle,

31:08.880 --> 31:10.880
shouldn't we make some preparations?

31:10.880 --> 31:11.790
Prepare for what?

31:11.790 --> 31:13.000
Take our weapons!

31:14.920 --> 31:15.450
For what?

31:15.830 --> 31:16.890
To fight Zhou Rong.

31:21.160 --> 31:22.400
Zheng, Zheng.

31:23.920 --> 31:26.200
Some things shouldn't be rushed.

31:28.510 --> 31:29.270
Hang it up

31:30.480 --> 31:31.750
and let the wind blow.

31:37.070 --> 31:38.070
Let's go to sleep.

31:39.750 --> 31:41.300
Let the wind blow?

31:48.350 --> 31:49.720
So many people in Fenglinwan

31:49.720 --> 31:51.120
couldn't stop these two?

31:51.590 --> 31:53.720
Both of them were too good at fighting.

31:53.790 --> 31:55.110
So you tried to stop them but failed.

31:55.110 --> 31:56.310
By the time we got the news,

31:56.310 --> 31:57.770
they had already run away.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.460
Yibo!

31:59.750 --> 32:01.130
Bowen is one of our own.

32:01.160 --> 32:03.160
We should've looked out for him
on our turf!

32:03.160 --> 32:03.720
Rong,

32:04.200 --> 32:05.130
you have no idea.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.370
Lang Bowen was drunk

32:06.510 --> 32:08.310
and stirred up trouble
in every private room.

32:08.310 --> 32:08.790
Other than you,

32:08.790 --> 32:10.920
who else could keep him under control?

32:12.030 --> 32:13.110
Are you saying

32:13.720 --> 32:14.940
Bowen asked for it?

32:15.810 --> 32:17.020
Exactly.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.170
He just ran into two tough guys.

32:21.590 --> 32:22.160
Mr. Zhou,

32:22.830 --> 32:24.370
if you had been there,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.030
I would have definitely
fought them to the death!

32:26.030 --> 32:26.920
Save it!

32:27.790 --> 32:28.650
Mr. Zhou.

32:29.590 --> 32:30.390
We found them.

32:31.830 --> 32:32.400
Look.

32:33.070 --> 32:34.470
This is the clearest one.

32:35.400 --> 32:38.060
Look, the ones who came to your house
and beat...

32:40.720 --> 32:42.780
There's nothing else. You can leave.

32:43.110 --> 32:44.340
I-I'll get going.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.040
The ones who came to your house
and beat you up last time

32:47.940 --> 32:51.240
[Lobby 1]

32:49.070 --> 32:50.600
were also these two, right?

32:51.480 --> 32:54.740
I'd recognize those two
even if they were reduced to ashes.

32:55.110 --> 32:56.030
Right after snatching the phone,

32:56.030 --> 32:57.630
they went to find Lang Bowen.

32:58.270 --> 33:00.800
They must be trying
to get the phone password.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.550
Last night, Du Cong was

33:03.550 --> 33:05.510
hit right after leaving the company.

33:05.510 --> 33:06.550
Du Cong said

33:06.680 --> 33:07.700
the ones who hit him this time

33:07.700 --> 33:09.620
are the same ones from last time.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.810
The car he drove last time

33:11.810 --> 33:13.540
was the one you usually ride in.

33:14.440 --> 33:15.970
They wanted to mess with me?

33:17.250 --> 33:18.930
Could it be Zhu Yifei?

33:19.550 --> 33:21.590
But what's in it
for an antique trafficker like him?

33:21.590 --> 33:23.990
It definitely has something to do
with him.

33:24.350 --> 33:25.420
Could it be that

33:25.480 --> 33:27.830
someone is pulling the strings behind him?

33:27.830 --> 33:29.030
I don't care who it is.

33:29.880 --> 33:32.880
Who was the last person in Sanjiangkou
to mess with me?

33:33.270 --> 33:33.800
Lu Zheng.

33:35.720 --> 33:36.830
Even the Chief
of the Public Security Bureau is gone.

33:36.830 --> 33:39.030
Why would I fear an antique trafficker?

33:40.550 --> 33:41.350
I'll take some men right now

33:41.350 --> 33:42.410
to find Zhu Yifei.

33:43.160 --> 33:43.960
Wait a minute.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.100
Have Li Penggai

33:47.510 --> 33:48.510
go find the phone.

33:49.550 --> 33:50.410
You come with me

33:51.160 --> 33:52.290
to visit Lang Bowen.

33:54.310 --> 33:54.880
Okay.

33:55.410 --> 33:59.490
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital]

34:06.200 --> 34:06.730
Mr. Zhou.

34:07.200 --> 34:07.830
Mr. Zhou.

34:08.510 --> 34:09.230
Stay still.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.190
Well.

34:25.960 --> 34:26.489
Mr. Zhou.

34:27.190 --> 34:28.070
How are you doing?

34:28.070 --> 34:28.550
I...

34:30.840 --> 34:31.670
It hurts.

34:34.920 --> 34:37.250
I just had the doctor
give me a painkiller.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.330
You're in high spirits.

34:41.630 --> 34:43.150
Seems like you're not hurt too badly.

34:43.150 --> 34:44.210
I have a bone crack.

34:44.710 --> 34:46.610
The doctor said I need to improve
my blood circulation

34:46.610 --> 34:47.739
to recover quickly.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.150
Watching this can speed up

34:49.150 --> 34:50.409
my blood circulation.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.570
Did you get an X-ray?

34:52.800 --> 34:53.400
Yes, I did.

34:54.400 --> 34:55.360
Mr. Zhou, Ren, you're here.

34:55.360 --> 34:56.150
Yangyang.

34:56.360 --> 34:57.510
Why are you here again?

34:57.510 --> 34:58.570
I brought you food.

35:00.230 --> 35:01.960
Bring out the X-ray film for me.

35:06.170 --> 35:07.430
Here you are, Mr. Zhou.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.680
Read that report

35:08.840 --> 35:09.760
to Mr. Zhou.

35:11.580 --> 35:12.870
[Scan Report]

35:11.880 --> 35:13.140
Imaging findings show

35:13.150 --> 35:15.400
a proximal diaphyseal fracture
of the lower leg.

35:15.400 --> 35:16.760
The fracture line is transverse

35:16.760 --> 35:18.480
and located in the middle of the tibia.

35:18.480 --> 35:20.110
The fracture line is clearly visible.

35:20.110 --> 35:22.110
Both ends
of the fracture are well-aligned

35:22.110 --> 35:23.670
with no obvious dislocation.

35:23.670 --> 35:26.480
No abnormalities are seen
in the surrounding soft tissue.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.440
Didn't you say it was a bone crack?

35:27.440 --> 35:28.590
How come it is a fracture now?

35:28.590 --> 35:29.650
It doesn't matter.

35:30.550 --> 35:32.150
How long will it take to heal?

35:33.920 --> 35:35.420
A bone injury like this

35:35.630 --> 35:37.160
will take at least 100 days.

35:41.760 --> 35:42.350
You see,

35:42.670 --> 35:44.870
I can't move at a crucial time like this.

35:49.150 --> 35:50.880
Have you found those two jerks?

35:51.190 --> 35:52.850
We're still looking for them.

35:55.030 --> 35:56.290
I can't be of much help.

35:57.360 --> 35:58.690
Focus on your recovery.

35:59.230 --> 36:00.230
I need to recover,

36:00.510 --> 36:02.440
but the work still needs to be done.

36:02.960 --> 36:03.960
Take all the guys outside

36:03.960 --> 36:04.820
with you later.

36:04.920 --> 36:05.840
No way.

36:06.000 --> 36:08.530
You need people around you
in this condition.

36:08.550 --> 36:09.480
Mr. Zhou,

36:10.590 --> 36:12.520
I can get the priorities straight.

36:12.670 --> 36:13.800
At a crucial time like this,

36:13.800 --> 36:16.660
finding the phone
matters more than anything else.

36:20.440 --> 36:21.590
How about I find you a specialist

36:21.590 --> 36:23.050
in the provincial capital

36:23.230 --> 36:25.150
to get a second opinion
and avoid a misdiagnosis?

36:25.150 --> 36:26.190
Don't bother.

36:26.840 --> 36:28.240
It's just a minor injury.

36:28.320 --> 36:30.450
Doctors in Sanjiangkou can handle it.

36:35.920 --> 36:36.510
Bowen,

36:37.760 --> 36:38.680
caffeine

36:38.780 --> 36:40.380
comes from coffee cherries.

36:41.070 --> 36:43.440
So, every cause has an effect,

36:43.880 --> 36:45.590
and every effect has a cause.

36:50.070 --> 36:50.770
Bowen,

36:51.440 --> 36:52.840
Mr. Zhou means

36:53.110 --> 36:54.310
that in some matters,

36:54.630 --> 36:56.090
we are all in the same boat.

36:56.800 --> 36:57.670
I'm very curious.

36:57.670 --> 36:59.030
Why did you go to Fenglingwan

36:59.030 --> 37:00.360
to drink and pick a fight

37:00.550 --> 37:01.920
right after I called you

37:01.960 --> 37:04.220
and talked about the lost phone? Well...

37:04.360 --> 37:05.560
It's weird, isn't it?

37:12.070 --> 37:13.510
If my suspicion is wrong,

37:16.110 --> 37:18.370
I'll lose this hand of mine to you, Bowen.

37:18.840 --> 37:20.040
But there's no knife.

37:20.400 --> 37:21.000
Yangyang.

37:21.400 --> 37:22.540
Go find a scalpel.

37:22.920 --> 37:23.550
Jianren,

37:24.230 --> 37:25.960
come at me if you have a problem.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.330
Don't scare my brother.

37:30.280 --> 37:31.840
And I must correct you.

37:33.040 --> 37:34.280
What do you mean by "in some matters,

37:34.280 --> 37:35.810
we are all in the same boat"?

37:37.000 --> 37:38.120
In all matters,

37:38.150 --> 37:39.670
we are all in the same boat.

37:40.880 --> 37:42.010
Am I right, Mr. Zhou?

37:42.110 --> 37:42.890
Exactly.

37:43.000 --> 37:44.530
Who are you trying to scare?

37:47.150 --> 37:47.880
Yes, Mentor.

37:49.920 --> 37:50.720
I see, Mentor.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.200
Don't worry, Mentor.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.730
Chief Zhang, time for the meeting.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.160
What's wrong?

38:07.480 --> 38:09.480
Who on earth has got such a big mouth?

38:10.440 --> 38:11.960
The news about Li Qian getting injured
at Zhou Rong's place

38:11.960 --> 38:13.760
has been spread to my mentor again.

38:13.760 --> 38:14.320
Not me.

38:23.100 --> 38:24.100
Sorry, Yangyang.

38:25.480 --> 38:27.280
Mr. Zhou, why would you say that?

38:27.630 --> 38:29.190
Letting you see that scene just now,

38:29.190 --> 38:31.390
I owe you an apology as your big brother.

38:31.480 --> 38:33.280
Please don't say that, Mr. Zhou.

38:34.190 --> 38:35.280
Are you also wondering

38:35.280 --> 38:36.840
how I could suspect your brother

38:36.840 --> 38:38.540
since we've known each other for 20 years?

38:38.540 --> 38:40.070
[Nurse Station]

38:40.540 --> 38:41.800
Actually, I also understand

38:41.800 --> 38:44.070
that he doesn't want you
to know about our business.

38:44.070 --> 38:45.570
But this time,

38:45.880 --> 38:47.080
it's really serious.

38:47.630 --> 38:49.560
It's a matter of his life and death.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.140
But look at him.

38:51.190 --> 38:52.230
Even at a time like this,

38:52.230 --> 38:54.160
he still acts like he doesn't care.

38:55.880 --> 38:56.610
Mr. Zhou,

38:56.760 --> 38:58.320
may I ask what it is?

39:00.070 --> 39:00.880
Yesterday, two people

39:00.880 --> 39:01.940
broke into my house

39:02.360 --> 39:03.590
and stole a phone.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.400
That phone

39:05.670 --> 39:06.920
stores the only evidence

39:06.920 --> 39:08.850
that your brother killed Lu Zheng.

39:09.110 --> 39:10.170
Do you understand?

39:12.400 --> 39:13.670
But now his leg is injured.

39:13.670 --> 39:14.870
What should we do now?

39:15.440 --> 39:16.190
You may go back

39:16.190 --> 39:17.850
and take care of your brother.

39:20.030 --> 39:20.670
Go back.

39:32.510 --> 39:33.760
Bowen, why are you out of bed?

39:33.760 --> 39:34.760
Is your leg okay?

39:35.400 --> 39:37.330
I'm just getting my blood flowing.

39:38.000 --> 39:40.000
What's in that barrel?

39:40.150 --> 39:41.550
Didn't you think the hospital food

39:41.550 --> 39:42.150
tasted awful?

39:42.150 --> 39:43.880
I made some especially for you.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.400
Thank you.

39:46.630 --> 39:48.760
Do you think I dare to eat what you cook?

39:49.440 --> 39:51.500
If you really want me to get well soon,

39:51.920 --> 39:53.580
buy me some more of these nuts.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.210
Is Zhou Rong

39:57.510 --> 39:58.960
very unhappy?

40:02.510 --> 40:03.440
Mr. Zhou told me

40:03.440 --> 40:05.300
that the phone you're looking for

40:05.320 --> 40:06.720
stores the only evidence

40:06.760 --> 40:08.160
that you killed Lu Zheng.

40:08.800 --> 40:10.350
He even told you that?

40:11.190 --> 40:12.320
Is it true, brother?

40:20.230 --> 40:22.430
Zhou Rong is really getting desperate.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.230
Bowen,

40:23.760 --> 40:25.820
I'll go help Mr. Zhou find that phone.

40:26.710 --> 40:27.240
Help who?

40:28.070 --> 40:28.800
He's crazy.

40:28.840 --> 40:29.900
Are you crazy, too?

40:30.150 --> 40:31.610
Zhou Rong is about to flee.

40:32.670 --> 40:33.360
Flee?

40:34.400 --> 40:35.770
Why would Mr. Zhou flee?

40:36.070 --> 40:37.270
Because he's scared.

40:37.760 --> 40:40.400
When people are scared,
they just want to run away.

40:40.400 --> 40:41.550
Have you ever thought about

40:41.550 --> 40:43.210
what you'll do if he runs away?

40:43.230 --> 40:44.920
I don't know who wants to mess with him,

40:44.920 --> 40:47.320
but it definitely has nothing
to do with me.

40:47.670 --> 40:49.190
Then let me ask you a question.

40:49.190 --> 40:50.920
When did you change your phone?

40:51.320 --> 40:52.520
How would I remember?

40:53.440 --> 40:54.150
I remember.

40:55.030 --> 40:56.440
The day after Lu Zheng died,

40:56.440 --> 40:57.770
you changed your phone.

40:59.630 --> 41:00.760
What Mr. Rong said is true.

41:00.760 --> 41:01.960
You killed Lu Zheng.

41:03.320 --> 41:04.400
Go tell the police.

41:04.440 --> 41:05.030
Go now.

41:06.550 --> 41:07.070
Bowen,

41:07.320 --> 41:08.960
we can't let Mr. Zhou run away.

41:08.960 --> 41:10.860
If he escapes and his phone
falls into the hands of the police,

41:10.860 --> 41:11.920
you'll be done for.

41:12.230 --> 41:14.250
Just don't meddle in the business,

41:14.590 --> 41:15.520
my dear brother.

41:16.190 --> 41:17.930
Just put your mind at ease.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.130
Your brother

41:20.190 --> 41:22.190
will even get through this obstacle

41:22.190 --> 41:23.150
safe and sound.

41:25.440 --> 41:26.550
Just don't worry.
